AGV [text box]
Select the vehicle that you want to use for the Automated Guided Vehicle (AGV) of the Automated Guided
Vehicle System (AGVS) in your model.
Remarks
Note
By default, the Transporter in the folder MUs in the Class Library is the AGV. For this reason the
methods, attributes, and read-only attributes of the Transporter apply to the AGV as well.
Plant Simulation creates the specified Amount of AGVs during the init phase of the simulation run.
For the AGV that drives freely within the area, you can define these settings for the Distance Control:
Length Zone 1, ΔWidth Zone 1, Length Zone 2, and ΔWidth Zone 2
