Shift Calendar [AGVPool]
Select the ShiftCalendar. It contains the data of the shifts in your installation and controls during which
shifts the AGVPool works in the plant.
Remarks
Click the ellipsis button and select the ShiftCalendar in the dialog Select Object.
Or select the ShiftCalendar in a Frame, drag it to the text box and drop it there. Plant Simulation then
automatically enters the objects into the list of the objects on the tab Resources of the ShiftCalendar.
You can edit the contents of the text boxes with the commands on the Context Menu of Embedded Lists.
